  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>32</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msup></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>adj</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">-</mo><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>adj</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>adj</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>|</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mo>|</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mo>|</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mo>|</mo><mn>4</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>21</mn></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>25</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>32</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
